{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほー(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ絢音ちゃんと夢の国に\n行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶叫系の乗り物が2人とも苦手で\nインディージョーンズを何回も\n繰り返し乗ってました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふざけて笑って楽しい1日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで行った中で1番といって\nいいほどすごく充実してたんじゃ\nないかな〜と思います(O_O)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のヒヤッとした出来事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ私のマーマさん、\n自販機で飲み物をカードで\n買おうとしたのに\n保険証で払おうとしていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでだろー？おかしいなぁー？\nって何度もピッってやってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黙って見ていました（＾ω＾）\n心の中では爆笑してました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに部屋の模様替えしたの！\nたまにはこういうのもいいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の部屋は白で統一されてるよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー♪\n自分はコメントしたのに載ってない\nって方は安心してね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"順次載せていきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月誕生日の方、まだまだ受け付けてます\n教えてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回から始めた大喜利。\nあの写真とお題は難しかったよね\nごめんね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方たちが提案してくれた\n「写真で一言」の方がやりやすいかな\nって思ったからそうするねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の写真で一言はこれ！\nコメント見るのがさらに楽しくなった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『前回の写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大喜利？にたくさんの方が参加\nしてくれました。\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中からいいなと思ったのを\n紹介していきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.47 ゆう❻ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはこの写メのアヒル口に\n気付いてくれるかなぁ（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.98 ヘルプマン木村 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この煎餅ちょー硬いんだけどぉー。\nどうなってんのー？\nあーまじチョベリバー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.188 乃木坂大好きなshinjiさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は何故、自撮りをしながら、\nたたずんで煎餅を食べているんだ？\nよし、明日も頑張ろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.319 りき⊿あしゅ神推し さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな写真誰に需要があるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.329 まさるん@なんちゃって保育士 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からライザップ通うからこれは\n食べても大丈夫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.371 しらたま さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ、河童のお皿なん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.380 サファイア茄子 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるほど、これが\"Japan\"の味か..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.474 シュウタ☆ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この煎餅めっちゃみり愛(美味や)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.605 堀未央奈 さん(本人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい、靴下穴あいてるやつ履いて来ちゃった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.709 としき⊿あさがお棒人間 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰がフリスビーをキャッチした犬や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.805 うえぽん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会の会員費これだけで\n足りてると思ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウーっฅ(๑•̀ω•́๑)ฅー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もまた受け付けてるよん(･∀･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この制服ももう終わり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ある位置、今やらなければいけない\n課題を見つけクリアしていきたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"so